{"compatibility":"as-is","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: as-is.

Protected data: none.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

No changes were required. The program has no data block, no model block sampling statements, and no parameters requiring priors. The generated quantities simulate ordinal data but do not condition on any protected interface variable.
","model_safe_stan":"functions {
  vector induced_dirichlet_rng(int K, real phi) {
    vector[K - 1] c;
    vector[K] p = dirichlet_rng(rep_vector(1, K));

    c[1] = phi - logit(1 - p[1]);
    for (k in 2:(K - 1))
      c[k] = phi - logit(inv_logit(phi - c[k - 1]) - p[k]);

    return c;
  }
}

transformed data {
  int<lower=1> N = 50; // Number of observations
  int<lower=1> K = 5;  // Number of ordinal categories
}

generated quantities {
  real gamma = normal_rng(0, 1);                  // Latent effect
  ordered[K - 1] c = induced_dirichlet_rng(K, 0); // (Internal) cut points
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=K> y;                     // Simulated ordinals

  for (n in 1:N)
    y[n] = ordered_logistic_rng(gamma, c);
}
","data_safe_json":"{}","protected_variables":[]}
